{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "012yus_305_2_3_012_05_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:73167b324a7eb4c81fd5163b6fd19f384e46fa588c5a8e764a0ca07204f3fbcd",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:012yus_305_2_3_012_05_09_a:2_3_012_05_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:802f40700fbeb2b57cb12e68980bad7a914da1ba5b1aba2866c2d712e08e4186",
      "text": "喂喂，●●●●●●●●●●监督！\n我想出来的“天空婚礼”，觉得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_305_2_3_012_05_09_a:2_3_012_05_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f08d2171e9a7f08ac5566f190333fce247771e75dee743a256a26db96afecf72",
      "text": "虽然一开始怎么也\n想不出好点子……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_305_2_3_012_05_09_a:2_3_012_05_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8225a5d0c35547ae93d78beb31e74b1ca39d6b76f5ad4c4edec8d70abb6c4d55",
      "text": "但看着晴朗的天空，我就想着\n好想从这片天空向全世界传达心意啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_305_2_3_012_05_09_a:2_3_012_05_09_a:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eca3eddfe22359ca03f29523517ee489aa979cc111c695994bdecf9ab0e077f3",
      "text": "很棒。一定能够\n传达到的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_305_2_3_012_05_09_a:2_3_012_05_09_a:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41df9931e9b3d61c75d4aad667fed73cf2ca36f0265552de9c5789d6abcc3213",
      "text": "热气球真是极好的\n构想呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_305_2_3_012_05_09_a:2_3_012_05_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18d2f81d3512754cb8c5cadceb0357e59931fd7d1a788736294baabe93a95363",
      "text": "毕竟是一辈子一次的重要活动嘛，\n我超级干劲十足的♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_305_2_3_012_05_09_a:2_3_012_05_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bbe1f0eef8da50e46fdf6883285def182ef8f96f318bf1e8e542621f27d2c90",
      "text": "其他大家的设计，也是连我都想不到的\n有趣编排呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_305_2_3_012_05_09_a:2_3_012_05_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8965d84e4e0f73975d3f4581b5c7bc14ab10b31102d6ac2a8c6bd692bb0a755a",
      "text": "啊，要是监督的话会策划怎样的婚礼呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_305_2_3_012_05_09_a:2_3_012_05_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58a748cbed611ffa1dfd4f87da9e10294aff0453bb0f344018a938f31b25f4fe",
      "text": "一定是能让新娘、新郎，还有前来的宾客，\n所有人都展露笑容的婚礼吧～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_305_2_3_012_05_09_a:2_3_012_05_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3173009860e7277a74bb0a16acb5308bee6d7e9cb1217cb7165561067d7a092f",
      "text": "那就回头见啦，监督。辛苦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
